WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.784 --> 00:00:14.708
C'est qui sur la photo ?
Who is that in the photo?

2
00:00:14.808 --> 00:00:21.092
C'est ma famille. Voici mon père, ma mère et ma sœur.
That's my family. Here are my father, my mother and my sister.

3
00:00:21.192 --> 00:00:24.788
Elle a quel âge, ta sœur ?
How old is your sister?

4
00:00:24.888 --> 00:00:29.420
Elle a quinze ans. Elle s'appelle Chloé.
She's fifteen. Her name is Chloé.

5
00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:32.204
Tu as des frères ?
Do you have any brothers?

6
00:00:32.304 --> 00:00:38.180
Non, je n'ai pas de frère. Mais j'ai mes grands-parents à Lyon.
No, I don't have a brother. But I have my grandparents in Lyon.
